```

## Develop

```bash
make install   # venv + editable install with the "[[ test_extras ]]" extras
make test
make lint
```

## CI / Release

- **CI** runs via the shared [`argus-ci`](https://github.com/[[ github_owner ]]/argus-ci) reusable workflow.
- **Release** publishes to PyPI (OIDC trusted publishing) and GHCR on `v*` tags.
- Versioning is derived from git tags via `hatch-vcs` — tag `vX.Y.Z` to cut a release.

